{"login": "sverhoeven", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "a51959fe7ae635501546dfe5cd8254824156c554", "message": "During POST return absolute job url as header 'Location' value and http code 201 (Created) and return no body.\nJob status no longer contains an url field as the url used to fetch it is the identifier.", "created_at": "2013-05-23T15:28:39Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "47cf43317f82b507e65e3b1ecf6ec026f45c2cc1", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master'", "created_at": "2013-05-23T08:26:41Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "76648dafd11fcdcb7f40ed8ef82a2a997ab70313", "message": "After a job cancel the state of the job was not updated. Causing job state to be stuck at state before cancelation.\nNow right after cancel the state is updated.\n\nUpdate status after sandbox has been downloaded, to prevent client to read results prematurely while they are being copied from sandbox.\n\nLog exception in JobsPoller with error loglevel and with stacktrace.\n\nOnly download sandbox if job has been completed without exception.", "created_at": "2013-05-22T15:19:48Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9cfeb42c5b591b10dad0c420bde490dc5c0c29b2", "message": "The state string is scheduler specific so we can't tell when job is done by using only the state string.\nWhether job is done can be determined from isDone() and getException() of JobStatus instance.\nSend jsonified status object to callback.\n\nDo not serialize exception as it gives to much information, just return exception message.", "created_at": "2013-05-22T10:21:10Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fa35c381c2373fb9b776d0b47934b38d269c5b29", "message": "Octopus now has running field in JobStatus.\nAlso add running field to JobStatusResponse.\n\nIncreased test coverage of JobStatusResponse.", "created_at": "2013-05-22T10:20:49Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95e6c6cdac24fb42152c3119a1b45caf2e01a4f2", "message": "Use cancelTimeout from config file and set it as maxTime in JobDescription.", "created_at": "2013-05-15T07:38:50Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5a57f725d014f7c5f385ae89625c896698a87f9e", "message": "Add human readable form to interval and timeouts in example config file.", "created_at": "2013-05-14T15:06:43Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "791628c01b8dbea5f8071e5204f6777cf0d0aa16", "message": "Octopus job now has a UUID.\nUse url as identifier for a job.\nIdentifier in url is the UUID of a job.", "created_at": "2013-05-14T12:18:33Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d10d7be1aff07cb0f83bfc18f74d403a049962ba", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master'", "created_at": "2013-05-14T10:07:50Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fe2229cb265da9c05d2ccbe31671ae42508014a9", "message": "Add config flag to make http client work for self signed certs.", "created_at": "2013-05-14T10:07:11Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c8fd4a751af94765d8e0b3d271c17e6c861eb2ba", "message": "Make json the media type which is consumed and produced.\n\nAdd url to sandboxed job.\n\nReturn SandboxedJob as response to POST and GET of job.\n\nMake GET /job return list of urls of jobs, to minimize amount of json returned.", "created_at": "2013-04-29T13:14:43Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ac5d1207b9d5f5897c65ef921e3a0e883210a94", "message": "Add configuration file for integration tests.\n\nRemove adaptor dir as it is no longer needed.\n\nMake additional jars with src and javadoc.\n\nFix javadoc warnings.", "created_at": "2013-04-29T09:39:35Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5fbef3a32a30a3b90fdd67fde9401890cc103972", "message": "Add jsch as dependency.\n\nMove /jobs to /job.\n\nAdd GET /job.", "created_at": "2013-04-26T14:06:02Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c666026fae3efa367c1fd7df4cdf90da069c273b", "message": "Adjust tests as Octopus changed constructor of JobImplementation.", "created_at": "2013-04-26T10:16:54Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c0138379d68ee0a3af8d1a0b6ec9334ae3af6e35", "message": "When downloading sandbox replace existing files.", "created_at": "2013-04-25T13:38:43Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cccc91d629c6953092caa9234fb3c084ca5cef0b", "message": "Add missing license headers.", "created_at": "2013-04-24T18:15:56Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9c13349b73b805da5b7442a9f6f4a6db6024d45", "message": "Renamed JobLauncherResource to JobResource.\nMove submission of job to JobsResource.\n\nAdd job url to response of job submission.\n\nIn octopus manager don't throw jersey exception, instead throw standard exception and in resource catch it and throw jersey exception.\n\nAdded some more javadoc.", "created_at": "2013-04-24T17:21:33Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a4ca179e477838bb31e0bc1ef765997193c7acb8", "message": "Move cleanSandbox() to SandboxedJob class.\n\nChange status equals check so it only reports change when status.getState() is different.", "created_at": "2013-04-24T15:00:15Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dd36efbd1bfa0c972619088fa69ec918897c5f6d", "message": "Fix some PMD warnings.", "created_at": "2013-04-24T14:59:08Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a139c4068659a57838688f6431f1fd93d2db7361", "message": "Dont run integration test during test goal.\nRun integration tests using verify goal.\n\nUp plugin versions.", "created_at": "2013-04-24T14:55:07Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cd6ae1a5588662eec88877edc6a3144222e51f28", "message": "Add example responses.\n\nDisabled test which fail due to jar in jar loading mechanism.", "created_at": "2013-04-19T10:00:14Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5302a6f2ef47e41e89f242377273c4b88d9b35ea", "message": "Remove octopus argument from toJobDescription in JobSubmitRequest.\nAdded ignored tests for JobSubmitRequest.\nAwaiting fix for https://github.com/NLeSC/octopus/issues/53 to enable tests.", "created_at": "2013-04-19T09:13:07Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "94eb3aed4de25fc90804cffef33e8593f8935fb7", "message": "Merge branch 'develop'", "created_at": "2013-04-19T07:52:00Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "39b01b6b34f446f7d73d24a90ff3939a6575eb60", "message": "Renaming in tests incomplete.", "created_at": "2013-04-19T07:51:30Z", "repo": "octopus-job-ws", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e248ea80dc6c31498614864f079eb102ead5fc8b", "message": "Update banner.txt\n\nUse banner from http://www.geocities.